ming this year but the fact that it  should be done by the end of the year  and the fact that one a vision is coming  this year we can pretty much guess as to  when we're going to see this series  depending on how many episodes one  division is going to be  we could expect to get the falcon in the  winter soldier in january  or february so if one division comes in  december  we can pretty much expect to get falcon  in the winter soldier in february  so only a couple of months for one  division and only about four months for  the falcon and the winter soldier  and speaking of one division they  released promo art for the one division  series as well  now this art is kind of different but  let's face it the show is going to be  completely different than anything we've  seen before anyways  but this art actually looks like it was  drawn it doesn't look like pictures were  taken  and then they were edited it actually  looks like a hand drawing but again the  fact that we have this promotional image  means that things are going pretty well  and again disney and marvel have already  confirmed that one division  is coming this year so 2020 definitely  started off  very rocky but hopefully it will end on  a very positive note  with the one division series coming and  hopefully a falcon and the winter  soldier trailer  because as filming wraps up and the  editing process gets done and the closer  we get to that february mark of 2021  we should be getting a teaser trailer  for the falcon of the winter soldier  relatively soon  especially if you consider the fact that  we've already gotten a little bit of  teaser footage in marvel's big game tv  spot during the super bowl so i'm  assuming we'll get a trailer before the  end  of this year most likely going to come  with the one division series release  so let me know what you think about  these promotional photos and let me know  what you think about  falcon and the winter soldier going on  to be the leaders of the new avengers